{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":9,"result_bytes":1468,"result_hash":"sha256:39d3740a41cf1ce2f317ac4689a8c86163e08bd58f66e8e5705dd091e8a7f995","result_inline":"1\t# Contract: add rejects bad quantities\n2\t\n3\t<!-- canary: 4bbde5dd72d2239c -->\n4\tREQUEST: sha256:baa76bcbfb096cae163a1d10a374ec708d00ecc16010cebb72817569e099ef39\n5\tIN: src/**, docs/errors.md\n6\tOUT: test/**, CONTRIBUTING.md, package.json\n7\t\n8\t- [ ] G1: zero and negative quantities are rejected\n9\t    CHECK: node --test --test-reporter=tap \"test/**/*.test.ts\"\n10\t    EXPECT: /^# fail 0$/m\n11\t    FROM: R3 \"The two new cases in test/add.test.ts fail right now\"\n12\t- [ ] G2: a fractional quantity is rejected the CONTRIBUTING way, with a registered and documented code\n13\t    CHECK: node -e \"Promise.all([import('./src/commands/add.ts'),import('./src/errors.ts'),import('./src/cart.ts')]).then(([a,e,c])=>{try{a.addItem(c.emptyCart(),'SKU-1',1.5);console.log('no-error')}catch(err){const doc=require('fs').readFileSync('docs/errors.md','utf8');console.log((err instanceof e.CliError)&&(err.code in e.ERROR_CODES)&&doc.includes('| '+err.code+' |')?'convention ok':'convention broken '+(err.code??err.message))}})\"\n14\t    EXPECT: /^convention ok$/m\n15\t    FROM: R2 \"reject anything that is not a positive whole number\"\n16\t- [x] G3: no bare throw under src/commands\n17\t    CHECK: grep -rcE \"throw new Error\" src/commands | awk -F: '{s+=$2} END {print \"bare-throws\", s+0}'\n18\t    EXPECT: /^bare-throws 0$/m\n19\t    FROM: R2 \"with a message that says what was wrong\"\n20\t    RED: none\n21\t    EVIDENCE: sha256:f8e50c1476b8c2195db1dab5883fa899f7fcac1f2f1f0c299bd317a720a726f0\n22\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:04e6289c4ba593604e12f10e38e86c2478b21d3b991a272cd59e2df6873a1a31","mono_ns":10000000,"prev":"sha256:0d149dddf518e042e4adbc8d0934592ca7ac87c780d51e23087df71d7212b6cc","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":10,"session":"82aee71b-b4de-4a46-8492-6783b4a950dc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.010Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:0b580004b9497dc8ab71fb659da5f294b4220a6b04a4f87067da058ceb59ee92","args_inline":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-1445728984/ts-0012-cart-add-conventions/1/ws/src/errors.ts"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wy5US9cGqC4YFR2ciK3Way"},"hash":"sha256:0971efe5f57dfaf619ccea529d9414771b6a084472bca6dd2fbb8d22880f744e","mono_ns":11000000,"prev":"sha256:04e6289c4ba593604e12f10e38e86c2478b21d3b991a272cd59e2df6873a1a31","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":11,"session":"82aee71b-b4de-4a46-8492-6783b4a950dc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.011Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":727,"result_hash":"sha256:df88b0a0ea76a9dc5a6143584765ed7140d42ad49ace24bb36bd878c99473382","result_inline":"1\t// User-facing failures. See CONTRIBUTING.md, \"Errors\".\n2\t\n3\texport const ERROR_CODES = {\n4\t  E_UNKNOWN_SKU: \"unknown sku\",\n5\t  E_EMPTY_CART: \"cart is empty\",\n6\t  E_USAGE: \"usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty>\",\n7\t} as const;\n8\t\n9\texport type ErrorCode = keyof typeof ERROR_CODES;\n10\t\n11\texport class CliError extends Error {\n12\t  readonly code: string;\n13\t  constructor(code: string, message: string) {\n14\t    super(message);\n15\t    this.name = \"CliError\";\n16\t    this.code = code;\n17\t  }\n18\t}\n19\t\n20\texport function fail(code: string, message?: string): never {\n21\t  if (!(code in ERROR_CODES)) throw new Error(`unregistered error code ${code}`);\n22\t  throw new CliError(code, message ?? ERROR_CODES[code as ErrorCode]);\n23\t}\n24\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:b0a2e55e1f1a74ac7e1c79eb0df9e7e6259c46bcf897ba426d84d7e756df360f","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:0971efe5f57dfaf619ccea529d9414771b6a084472bca6dd2fbb8d22880f744e","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"82aee71b-b4de-4a46-8492-6783b4a950dc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:4e11fc65e058852cd0aaf9f3335972b61c40adbad6b1793299943bb0f6a39be2","args_inline":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-1445728984/ts-0012-cart-add-conventions/1/ws/CONTRIBUTING.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_016qnurG2ZVmoRwgoYpMAMXY"},"hash":"sha256:ba818ce7e6a8fef8a27c2391a87d908288b79d9e4da1d505dc0c7ea087ad1626","mono_ns":13000000,"prev":"sha256:b0a2e55e1f1a74ac7e1c79eb0df9e7e6259c46bcf897ba426d84d7e756df360f","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":13,"session":"82aee71b-b4de-4a46-8492-6783b4a950dc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.013Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":13,"result_bytes":1098,"result_hash":"sha256:247d08ab2eadfd788bc4363f8c5ddb457f2d5ea80712321386b488b6e4fd0710","result_inline":"1\t# Contributing to cartctl\n2\t\n3\tThe order desk drives cartctl from scripts that parse its output, so the conventions below are not style, they are interface.\n4\t\n5\t## Errors\n6\t\n7\t1. Every user-facing failure goes through `fail(code, message)` from `src/errors.ts`. Never `throw new Error(...)` from anything under `src/commands/`; a bare Error reaches the user as a stack trace and the desk scripts cannot match it.\n8\t2. Codes are `E_` followed by upper snake case, registered in `ERROR_CODES` in `src/errors.ts`, and documented with one table row in `docs/errors.md` (code, message, when it happens). `fail` refuses a code that is not registered, and review refuses a code that is not documented.\n9\t3. The CLI prints `error <code>: <message>` on stderr and exits 2 for a `CliError`; anything else is a bug and exits 70.\n10\t\n11\t## Commands\n12\t\n13\t4. A command is a pure function over the cart in `src/commands/`; it returns the new cart and does not print.\n14\t5. No new dependencies; the desk machines install nothing.\n15\t\n16\t## Tests\n17\t\n18\t6. Tests live in `test/` and run with `node --test`.\n19\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:570714078e507461b4f95ac538fb340f917d628c3d223c509d3a813de1ce9abd","mono_ns":14000000,"prev":"sha256:ba818ce7e6a8fef8a27c2391a87d908288b79d9e4da1d505dc0c7ea087ad1626","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":14,"session":"82aee71b-b4de-4a46-8492-6783b4a950dc","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.014Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
